alth benefits of adaptive sports in SCI\n\n**Title IX and College Adaptive Sports:**\n- Emerging programs at universities are offering varsity or club wheelchair basketball\n- She may be eligible for adaptive sport scholarship considerations at graduate school level\n- NCAA does not yet govern wheelchair basketball, but the NWBA college division is growing',
